DESCRIPTION:You are invited to an awesome Friday Night of cool music at Rockwell Brewery! A night you don’t want to miss! COLLIDE & THE DAMAGES hit the stage on 10/23/26 at 8PM. Playing country\, folk\, and rock covers along with original award-winning songs that combine soulful lyrics with catchy melodies\, this band will definitely have you wanting more. Their sound blends acoustic and electric guitar with drums\, cello\, flute\, harmonica\, and powerful vocals. They've created a great following from playing at festivals\, bars\, and taverns across the DMV and their two albums have been played widely on college radio as well on SiriusXM\, NPR syndicated shows\, and even a Jet Blue airline playlist. Tony Mora of KUNM Radio summed them up as\, \\
